## Title: Lazy Crown
## Author: absolventR3M
## Version: 0.3.1
## AddOnVersion: 13
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## Description: Too lazy to lead? In Cyrodiil, Lazy Crown randomly picks your next keep, resource, town or outpost to take, or a keep or outpost to defend, keeps a scoreboard, and comes with personalities. Wheel entries via LibRadialMenu, or /lazycrown in Text Chat. Instructions: Main Menu > Add-Ons > Lazy Crown.
## DependsOn: LibRadialMenu>=9
## OptionalDependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings LibGroupCombatStats
## SavedVariables: LazyCrownSV

Boot.lua
LazyCrown.lua
QuestData.lua
Personalities.lua
Group.lua
Travel.lua
